        <mxCell id="glossary-left" value="中英對照 / Bilingual Glossary&#xa;&#xa;Command Execution and Feedback = 指令執行與回饋&#xa;Current connected peer decides the legal command path; feedback then explains progress. = 當前連線對象決定合法的指令路徑；回饋再解釋進度&#xa;Reality-first read: App sends one command inside the current active session. That session decides whether the live path is Central-side or Firmware-side. = 以現實為先的讀法：應用程式在當前工作階段內送出一個指令；該工作階段決定走中央側還是韌體側路徑&#xa;Current Active Session = 當前工作階段&#xa;App can operate on only one connected peer at a time. = 應用程式一次只能操作一個已連線對象&#xa;CC bridge = CC 橋接韌體&#xa;Gateway = 閘道&#xa;End Device = 終端裝置&#xa;Connect to one peer only. = 一次只連一個對象&#xa;That peer decides which live command path is legal. = 由該對象決定哪條即時指令路徑合法&#xa;App Command Layer = 應用程式指令層&#xa;User action becomes one command intent inside the current active session. = 使用者操作會在當前工作階段內形成一個指令意圖&#xa;User action = 使用者操作&#xa;Command intent = 指令意圖&#xa;Pending / retry UI = 等待中 / 重試介面&#xa;App local feedback = 應用程式本地回饋&#xa;Path Decision = 路徑判斷&#xa;Current connected peer decides which live command path is legal. = 當前連線對象決定哪條即時指令路徑合法&#xa;Current connected peer = 當前連線對象&#xa;decides the legal path = 決定合法路徑&#xa;selected peer = 已選對象&#xa;current command = 當前指令&#xa;if CC bridge = 若為 CC 橋接韌體&#xa;if Gateway / End Device = 若為閘道 / 終端裝置" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7d6;strokeColor=#c9a227;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#3b2f16;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="1040" width="890" height="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="glossary-right" value="中英對照 / Bilingual Glossary&#xa;&#xa;CC bridge -&gt; Central-side path = 連到 CC 橋接韌體 -&gt; 走中央側路徑&#xa;Gateway / End Device -&gt; Firmware-side path = 連到閘道 / 終端裝置 -&gt; 走韌體側路徑&#xa;Do not send one live command down both paths at once. = 不要讓單一即時指令同時走兩條路徑&#xa;Central-side Path = 中央側路徑&#xa;Used when current session is CC bridge; Central stays the authority owner. = 當前工作階段為 CC 橋接韌體時使用；Central 仍是權威真相擁有者&#xa;Command API accepted = 指令 API 已接受&#xa;Authoritative mutation = 權威狀態變更&#xa;Metadata / sync confirmation = 主資料 / 同步確認&#xa;Metadata / sync = 主資料 / 同步&#xa;confirmation = 確認&#xa;Firmware-side Path = 韌體側路徑&#xa;Used when current session is Gateway / End Device. = 當前工作階段為閘道 / 終端裝置時使用&#xa;CMD_V2 = 指令通道 V2&#xa;CMD_RESULT = 指令結果&#xa;Runtime observation = 執行期觀測&#xa;Feedback Semantics = 回饋語意&#xa;UI feedback explains where the command is in the lifecycle. = UI 回饋說明指令目前位於哪個生命週期階段&#xa;accepted = 已接受&#xa;succeeded = 已成功&#xa;failed = 已失敗&#xa;timed_out = 已逾時&#xa;retrying = 重試中&#xa;final state applied = 最終狀態已套用&#xa;accepted != final state applied = 已接受 不等於 最終狀態已套用&#xa;CMD_RESULT != Central truth = CMD_RESULT 不等於中央真值&#xa;retry keeps the same command intent = 重試保留同一個指令意圖&#xa;show pending = 顯示等待中" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7d6;strokeColor=#c9a227;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#3b2f16;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="940" y="1040" width="890" height="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
